# Every path routes to the repository owner, who is reviewer of record.
#
# AGENTS.md §2 is the single source of truth for the division of labour. Since the plan
# changed, that division is no longer by directory: Claude builds everything and Codex
# reviews what lands, so there are no per-agent zones left to encode here. The per-path
# lines below are kept only because a future split would start from them; today every one
